{"server":"cn","storyId":"act34side_level_act34side_03_end","groupId":"act34side","stageId":"act34side_03","title":"如海雪纷散","storyCode":"BP-3","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act34side/level_act34side_03_end.txt","sourceHash":"e43a5ba3cb7c43a1a6df16cdd1c0825f2511b04e25d2c0bd38ba42e68b0ccda4","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g6_aegirarena"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿维图斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乔迪，原来你还在这里。其他人都已经离开了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿维图斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我不知道今天会有一场评议会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿维图斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，这些检索记录......你提了很多问题。“海洋究竟有多辽阔，如果它比陆地大的话，大多少？”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿维图斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“阿戈尔的城市就一直待在海底吗，它可不可以升到海面上去？”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿维图斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“海底没有日夜，阿戈尔人如何区分日夜？”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿维图斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乔迪，你试图通过这样的方式来理解阿戈尔吗？我担心这只会徒增你的困惑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿维图斯先生，其实，我觉得很激动，没有来由地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_i04"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我看过审判庭绘制的海图，离开海岸线几海里，就只剩下了代表未知的蓝灰色空白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"甚至在一些条件极度恶劣的地区，我们连海岸线都无法接近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可在你们的海图上，每一个角落都有那么多信息。地质、能源、生态，我甚至点不完那些无穷无尽的页面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大洋腹地的森林、永恒不化的冰山、海沟深处的热泉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就在刚刚，有那么一个瞬间，我觉得大地、天空、海洋，都触手可及。这世间的一切都是为我而准备的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，真是狂妄至极的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿维图斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，年轻人。这只是一种对于世界最质朴的向往。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可我......"},{"type":"narration","text":"年轻的阿戈尔人抬起头，怔怔望着眼前的珊瑚状终端。流动着字符的全息影像在他的脸庞上跃动，点亮那双柔软的眼睛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿维图斯先生，我来到这座城市已经一天多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我学不会使用你们的科技，听不懂你们在讨论的话题，甚至连方向都搞不明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚那场评议会......我也理解不了你们解决争议的方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我刚刚搜索了船舶设计师布雷奥甘——我曾以为他是我的先人。我看到了他的相貌，听到了他的录音，见到了他做过的设计......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"影像里的那个人真的和我有任何相似之处吗？他的后裔......真的会是我这个样子吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我、我找不到自己属于这里的痕迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“阿戈尔”就像一座高大而醒目的灯塔，我一直都知道它，可等到我终于看见了它的光亮，走到塔下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"却反而什么都看不清了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g6_aegirarena"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿维图斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“布雷奥甘”，我有多久未曾听人提起这个名字了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿维图斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布雷奥甘在阿戈尔也算得上是位奇人。他曾是技术院最有天赋的设计师，却在阿戈尔最需要他的时候，抛弃了一切前往陆地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿维图斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，这座城市和布雷奥甘还有些缘分，尽管这缘分有些，微妙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"微妙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿维图斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当年，布雷奥甘便是从这座城市前往的陆地，听说几位执政官还因为没能将他留下，险些受到了发展规划所的问责。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿维图斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，乔迪，我不能断言你与他是否存在血缘上的联系，但这种联系本身并不重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿维图斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是一名阿戈尔人，这是不言自明的事实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我懂，我是阿戈尔人，可如果连先人的血脉也无法追溯，我又该如何证明自己属于这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿维图斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们不需要证明自己的归属。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿维图斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我能理解你。我们都希望能从过往找到答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿维图斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿维图斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自豪地说，我是整个阿戈尔最为优秀的先史研究者之一，我相信历史的重量，历史蕴藏着真相与规律，它能告诉我们该往何处去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿维图斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（轻声）可如果历史告诉我，我们的家园和文明注定毁灭呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您刚刚说什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g4_aegirstreet_1"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"斯卡蒂，你还好吗？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你刚刚说了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉。我只是在想鲨鱼和剑鱼的情况。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"她们大概正在屠杀海里的弱小生物吧。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"她们大概在担心斯卡蒂现在怎么样了。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"打起精神来，斯卡蒂。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我并不担心她们，她们很强。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"以前没来到罗德岛的时候，我因为总会给身边的人带来灾祸，一直是孤身一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"没想到，现在又要经历这样的状况。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我在。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你怕自己会给歌蕾蒂娅她们带来灾祸？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"也许吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"不过之前，猎人们并不怕连累彼此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我们都背负着同样的厄运，所以我们并肩作战。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"但这一次，我想，我大概不只会牵连猎人们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我可能会将整个阿戈尔卷入灾难。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不会的，斯卡蒂。我相信你。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"队长之前也总是这么说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"交代作战方案的时候，他对别人都交代得很详细，但对我，他只会说他相信我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......他相信我即使记不下那些复杂的战术原理与策略，也能完成任务。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"那你相信他吗？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"队长一直都很可靠，也有很多办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"他每次出战前作的那些曲子我都还记得。他说因为海嗣不懂得音乐，所以曲子可以用作信号。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"可我觉得那些曲子都很好听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"他的方向感好得出奇，我们在迷宫般的巢穴中纷纷偏航的时候，他总能一个一个把我们带回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我们总能放心地仰赖他指引方向，直到......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"直到最后的那场战斗？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。那场战斗，一队与四队的猎人们用生命打开了一条通路，二队截住了回涌的海嗣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"队长冲在最前面，他很快到达了指定位置，“初生”的核心器官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"紧接着，我们失去了他的信号。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我以为他牺牲了。那么我该挥出那至关重要的一剑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"但他没有牺牲。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。我不知道那天具体发生了什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我其实也不知道现在他为什么没有回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"越是不知道，我越觉得自己该做些什么。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"相信自己，斯卡蒂，你有一名战士的直觉。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"记得吗，呯呯，咚，啪？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"呵——呯呯，咚，啪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我记住了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g12_seabed"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到达坐标位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的速度已经足够快......但似乎还是迟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里已经变成了一个巨大的填埋场。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g12_seabed"},{"type":"narration","text":"庞大的舰船残骸与海嗣尸骨交织在一起，在它们的映衬下，海水中飘荡的残余物像是纷飞的雪片。\n人们有时候会称之为“海雪”，但这样美丽的名字并不能掩盖它的实质——那是生物组织的碎片，既有海嗣的，也有人类的。\n腥甜的味道被舰炮残留的余热蒸腾，与雪片一同在海中纷散。\n深海猎人灵敏的嗅觉放大了每一种气味，幽灵鲨捂住了鼻子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g12_seabed"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鲨鱼，你不应该对眼前的场景感到陌生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"军团舰队以数量牵制住海嗣群体，深海猎人借机绕过正面战场，斩杀海嗣群体的核心，这是我们最为熟悉的战术。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"猎人们每一次从海嗣的巢穴离开，见到的都是这样的画面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们在陆地上待了太久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回想起来的感觉真不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一艘工程母舰，十余艘战列舰，还有更多的小型舰船......从残骸扎进海床的位置来看，舰队一直保持阵型，并非完全没有准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"附近的岩石有被重力发生装置破坏的痕迹。他们在遭遇袭击后第一时间尝试布设人造力场，制造真空断层来阻挡海嗣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但海嗣比他们更快，舰队甚至没来得及组成交叉火力网。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们和海嗣短兵相接......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"舰队的目的地是第三十七号巢穴，但从现场的情况来看，所有舰船的行进方向却是弥利亚留姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，既然舰队已经全军覆没，海嗣为什么没有下一步的动作？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剑鱼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔————"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，抓住我的手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说过，你应该乖乖待在巡逻舰上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"深潜装置只能帮助我们不被海水的重压挤成碎片，哪怕是阿戈尔人，没受过系统训练，也会像你这样被海流冲得东倒西歪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想笑就抓紧笑，笑完了赶紧帮我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样吧，你想象一下自己是在对付一个极其难缠的舞伴，反制她，找到平衡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很轻，这对你来说应该不难。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......别看我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就先往前了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"灯光阵列的残骸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"断裂的金属支杆上还残留着少量没有被海流卷走的组织碎片......人类的，还有，海嗣的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"检测结果与发展规划所提供的样本相匹配——是图利娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是弥利亚留姆在四十个小时前的停泊点，根据灯光阵列的位置来看，她当时是从城市边缘循环系统的排污口进入了海洋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......她为什么要离开城市？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很难从现场的情况推导出当时的情形，海流冲走了大部分的有效信息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"图利娅是否是对航道计划心怀怨恨的深海教徒，又究竟经历了什么......我们很难从这里得到答案了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里距离弥利亚留姆现在的停泊点有两个小时的航程，哪怕她身上有深潜装置......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也不可能游回城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而根据现场残留的组织碎片来看，她似乎还遭遇了海嗣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"图利娅不可能活下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"线索断了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是......深海猎人们出发的方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"战况或许比想象中还要激烈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"航道计划已经顺利推进到最后阶段，等到第三十七号巢穴的定位完成，我们便可以彻底驱除整片海域的海嗣，开启航道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"偏偏在这最关键的节点上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"图利娅的事情会不会与舰队遇袭有关？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又或者，围绕着她发生的所有事情，都只是有人为了转移海巡队的注意力而故布疑阵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"突然出现的变数太多，眼前的一切都像是被乱流所裹挟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......先返回城市吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g10_shipinterior"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈尔军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倾斜，加速！绕过前面那道山脊，再斜向折返，应该可以甩掉三分之一的追兵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈尔士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈尔士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"指挥官，海嗣已经侵入了船舱！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈尔士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们破坏了气密层！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈尔军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"领航员，船舱里的这些交给我们，你只需要负责继续玩好这场捉迷藏！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈尔士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......可是，仿海嗣涂层只剩下百分之十仍在生效，舰船很快就会完全暴露在它们的视野下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈尔军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尽最大可能争取时间，能拖多久是多久！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈尔士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1388_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咕——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鲨鱼，其他的交给你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈尔军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"深海猎人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歌蕾蒂娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈尔军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我认识您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈尔军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"执政官阁下，其他的舰船已经安全返回了弥利亚留姆吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈尔军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——幸好，幸好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈尔军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在保存下来尽可能多的有生力量，就能在之后发挥更大的作用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是这艘船的指挥官？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈尔军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈尔军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们遭遇了伏击。大批的海嗣离开了巢穴，出现在了舰队行进的途中......在此前的信标投放任务中，极少出现类似的情况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈尔军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们不能暴露作战部署，舰队应该撤离。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈尔军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们驾驶着舰队机动性最高的舰船，由我们留下来拖住海嗣，掩护主力舰队撤离，是最合理的战术安排。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们还剩多少人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈尔军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二十六人......不到十分之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈尔军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"执政官阁下，您为何一直在沉默？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈尔军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈尔军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈尔军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很遗憾，指挥官。这艘船是舰队唯一幸存的舰船，你们这二十六人，是最后的幸存者。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闯进船舱的海嗣都清理干净了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......你们掩护的那一千多人，在撤退的途中遭遇了规模更大的伏击。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我与歌蕾蒂娅赶到附近的山脊时，正好看到这艘船千方百计地在各种复杂的地形里穿梭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海嗣完成了对你们的包围，这艘船只是在包围圈里滑稽地打转......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈尔士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈尔军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈尔军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们没有完成作战任务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈尔军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反而是我们活了下来，牺牲比我们想象的要重，重很多......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们活了下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打起精神，阿戈尔人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们一样是阿戈尔最精锐的有生力量，你们一样可以在之后的作战中发挥更大的作用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和劳伦缇娜会带你们回到城市。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_263_skadi","aliases":["斯卡蒂"]}]}
